WEBVTT

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.330
Do you want to take away or drink here?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.000
--Drink here.
--Okay.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.290
I want a cup of brown sugar pearl
milk tea, less sugar, add red bean.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.250
I want a cup of oolong tea with
cheese foam, both takeaway, please.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.500
All right, all right, all right,

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.000
a cup of brown sugar pearl milk tea,

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.200
less sugar add red bean,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.700
a cup of oolong tea with cheese foam.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.620
May I know what size you want?

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.790
Uh, I want it large for both.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.790
Mum, do you know what's the
strongest power of Star of Justice?

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:02.870
I don't know.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.540
Oh ya, please separate
the cheese foam for me.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.080
Uh? okay, okay!

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.580
The one that can kick Greider away!

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.450
What is that called?

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:14.330
Dou Dou, I will play with you
once I finish my job, all right?

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.830
No, you can play with me for a while,

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:19.750
let dad finish all the jobs.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.500
Your dad cannot handle the job alone.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.000
Hello, the one in front,
why are you so slow?

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.870
Can you hurry up?

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.120
It's not my problem.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.080
Why are you rushing me?

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.250
Oh, sorry. It's ready soon!
It's ready soon!

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.120
Mom, just play with me for a while.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.870
You and Dad already ignored me
for the whole day.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:40.750
I told you not to come to
this internet celebrity shop.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.750
There are so many orders,
and they can't even manage the orders!

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.120
We are already in a queue,
just wait a bit more.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.370
Dou Dou, you can play
a while by yourself.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.250
When we go home tonight,
I will buy McDonald's for you, okay?

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.450
Here, it's your two cups of drinks.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.120
Oh no, please don't,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.830
I want it now, I want it now!

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:56.700
The business is so good.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.000
They should hire a few more workers.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.200
The husband and wife also brought a child.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.660
How can they manage this?

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.620
That's right,

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.950
I guess they want to take advantage of
the good business, and earn more money.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.410
Ahh, if they recruit people,
the taste might not be authentic.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.910
One cup, middle size juicy mango,
less ice, take away.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.580
I want a cup of taro ball
fresh milk, half sugar.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.830
--Oh okay, just wait a moment.
--Give me a cup of grass jelly boba tea,

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.500
and add on cheese foam.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:19.790
Mom, just play with me
for a while! Just for a while!

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.040
Nah,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.290
I'll give you my phone to watch cartoons.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.410
Good boy, you can sit on
the stool outside and watch.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.620
Okay!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.160
Yeah! Yeah! Time to play!

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.250
I told you this shop is delicious.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.660
I will bring her to drink next time.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.330
You can't beat me alone!

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.160
You are wrong,

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.120
not just me,

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.540
I have them!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.120
Star of Courage,

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.330
conquering the fear.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.580
Star of Justice,

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.950
bringing the hope.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.040
Star of Wisdom,

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.290
lighting up the lights.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.660
It will be done soon.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.450
Since three of you are here,

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:14.660
--Here are your drinks.
--I will destroy you all together!

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.750
Dou Dou!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.950
Dou Dou!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.830
Dou Dou!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.410
Dou Dou!

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.750
Wife, what's wrong?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.910
Dou Dou! Dou Dou is missing!

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.910
Dou Dou!

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:33.910
Dou Dou!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.120
Greed and lust
will destroy your everything!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.450
Farewell!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.870
Since that night,

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.620
Lu Guang and I didn't talk to each other.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.700
Since I can't save them,

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.450
what's the point of
bringing those words to them?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.910
Fool,

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.330
I told you before.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.040
No matter what has happened,

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.250
we can't change the past.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.200
Don't ask about the future.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.500
Because of us,
the future will definitely...

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.620
...change.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:13.620
I have to admit, at first I thought
the task seemed easy.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:14.660
But not a problem!

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.040
Following your instructions,
it will be so simple.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.540
If you say left, I will go left.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.540
If you say right, I will go right,
with no distractions!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.660
How is it? If we work together,
it is a big deal!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.700
Paying off the debt
is just around the corner!

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.870
I'm sorry,

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.290
for a period of time,

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.950
let's suspend the business first.

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.330
Lu Guang,

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.500
Cheng XiaoShi!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:58.910
What are you guys doing?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.750
Are you guys really
going to stop doing it?

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.200
I just want to rest,

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.830
the regular business for
the photo studio will continue.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.660
Cheng XiaoShi,

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.250
this is what you want, too?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.830
Uh, okay, we can start again
when you two are ready.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.830
Excuse me,

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.160
I heard there is a goddess
who can enter the time in a photo?

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.660
I'm sorry, our store
does not have this service.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.750
There is no goddess here.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.120
Please find someone else.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.830
My name is Xiao Li,

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.160
I'm a policeman.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.620
Why?

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.750
You two seem to be
sensitive to the police?

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.660
Ah, not really. Of course, we are!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.910
A policeman came to our door in broad
daylight. Who will be comfortable to this?

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.330
We are doing legitimate business here,

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.540
not all that weird stuff you said.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.620
Go, go, go,

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.330
there's nothing bad here, what a bad day!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.950
Why is this little girl's attitude so bad?

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.620
Comrade police, take your time.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.410
Please leave now.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.620
Don't let the neighbourhood know!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.500
I don't know how they will
spread the rumours!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.790
All right, all right, don't push me,

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.620
I'll go on my own.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.450
Master,

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.330
Master,

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.580
please do me a favour,

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.830
help me out.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.790
I heard people said
you can see the past in the photos,

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.160
can you take a look at it for me?

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:13.660
Help me,

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.250
help me to find my son!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.410
It's been three years
since Dou Dou was lost,

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.870
there's no news at all...

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.500
We've used all kinds
of methods, but it is...

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.750
...it is...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.250
Forget it, brother Liang,

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.330
they said it already,

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.950
it's not like how they
spread on the Internet.

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:33.410
You have been scammed for more than
a year, do you think it is a small amount?

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:36.250
All the money you spent, it's all gone!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.620
I promise you,

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.910
as long as I'm on the force,

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.580
I will not let this case be closed.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.500
Once there is a clue,

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.120
I'll let you know immediately.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.000
Okay?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.040
As long as there is a glimmer of hope,

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.620
I'm sure there are ways
to find my son back.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.660
I will not give up!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.200
You buy a jade turtle from me,
put it on the windowsill,

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:02.830
and put a pair of scissors
under the turtle,

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.040
in less than six months, you will know
your son's whereabouts!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.000
Dou Dou,

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.620
it's Dad's fault.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:13.450
Dad is sorry to you!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.450
Please come back!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.410
Dad shouldn't have let you
watch the cartoon alone,

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.120
it's dad's fault,

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.000
it's dad's fault!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.410
Uncle,

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:35.700
please stand up first.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:36.870
Brother Liang,

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.660
I know how you feel,

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.910
but this place is a photo studio.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.870
They can't do anything even
if you kneel on your knees.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.330
That's right,

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.580
if you have any old photos
that you want to print,

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.580
you can bring it here
and we will help you for free.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.080
It's good to do good things.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.250
Going back to the past...

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:57.370
...don't dream about it,

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.540
the past has already happened.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.540
Even God cannot change it.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.040
I advise you to
take care of your life now,

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.500
look forward.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.910
When the courier arrives,
please send it for me.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.620
The address is already on the package.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.950
Brother Liang,

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.080
this little brother's words
may be harsh, but he is not wrong.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.790
Why don't you go back
and take care of your wife?

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.370
That's right.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:25.660
Is your wife feeling better lately?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.790
You can't beat me alone!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:44.790
You are wrong,

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.040
not just me,

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.450
I have them!

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.750
Star of Courage,

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.950
conquering the fear.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.000
Star of Wisdom,

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.370
lighting up the lights.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.620
Star of Justice,

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:56.250
bringing the hope.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.620
Husband, husband,

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:00.000
I know what is the strongest
power of Star of Justice!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.700
Take a guess?

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.700
I don't know,

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.830
but today Xiao's team and I
have found another useful clue,

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.830
maybe we'll hear from Dou Dou soon.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.200
Take a guess,

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.620
just guess,

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.580
the one that always kicks Greider away!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.410
All right, all right, all right,
let me guess.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.370
Soaring bull to the sky?

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.910
No!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:21.450
Killing light?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.500
No!

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.450
Then what is it?

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:26.700
You don't know, right?

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.080
It is the heart of hope!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.200
The heart of hope,

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.700
give me the power of justice!

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.290
Greider, I will defeat you!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.120
Here!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:46.910
I gave you a milk tea,
why don't you thank me?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.000
Thank you.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.250
What were you looking at?

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.160
News about missing child?

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:57.200
Nothing, was browsing randomly.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.330
Since I just heard about this case,

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.540
I was curious to find out on the internet.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.540
That's a relief,
you're the same as you used to be.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.950
But why'd you say
such words to the father?

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.200
Such cold and merciless words.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:22.660
Okay,

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.200
finish the last bite.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.750
My wife is the best!

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:28.870
Actually,

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.500
this guy named Liang,

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.040
I saw him three years ago.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.620
Come, wipe your mouth.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.370
At that time near our school,

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.540
there was a new celebrities milk tea shop.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.040
I had consulted the Master
to figure it out,

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.870
next Tuesday, eight in the morning.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:44.120
It is the best for opening,
big fortune for us!

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.330
What Master,

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.450
is it accurate?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.080
Hope you are not being cheated again.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.870
Let me hold him, let me hold him,

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.200
you take a break.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.500
Dou Dou's name was also by the Master.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.500
Look how good looking our son is,

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.370
isn't that right?

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.080
Isn't that right?

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:01.910
But the good times did not last long.

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.500
The shop hasn't been open for long.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.250
The child was missing.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.200
Hey, the rain stopped.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.790
I'll go and distribute the flyers
to find our son.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.450
My dear wife, stay at home and watch TV,

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.870
don't go anywhere.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.160
Since three of you are here,

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:43.200
I will destroy you all together!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.660
After that, I could often see him
on the street near the school.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.660
He was bringing his wife,

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:55.540
pasting the missing person notice
over and over again.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.410
Give me another one.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.830
Hey, girl, try to have a look,

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.830
have you seen this kid nearby?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.410
Girl, have a look,

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:03.620
can you help me to recall about it?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.580
I'm sorry,

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.120
I have not seen him.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.750
Although I wanted to
tell him at that time,

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.790
but...

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.500
...I lied.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.120
There is such a moment in my memory...

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:27.870
I saw that child was taken by someone,

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.870
passed by in front of my eyes.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.700
I regretted that I didn't stop and ask

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.160
who was the one holding the kid.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:42.500
So, I am afraid to see
brother Liang again.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.580
I don't know how to face him...

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:53.450
...and the kid who is
wandering somewhere.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.120
After graduating from university,

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.580
I left that place.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.410
I thought I could escape from the past.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.620
But I didn't know...

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.950
...it has been three years...

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.950
...he still didn't give up.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.250
I want to make up for the mistake,

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.660
Cheng XiaoShi,

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:23.790
please help him.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:39.870
...isn't that right?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.580
Isn't that right?

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:51.200
Okay,

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.120
I promise you to help him

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.330
as a repayment

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.120
for buying me a milk tea in the rain.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.950
But,

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.450
the person who buys you milk tea

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:00.790
is not me.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:05.750
Anyway, thank you!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.450
Oh no,

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.700
I forgot to ask for brother Liang's
contact information.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.700
Hello, who?

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.700
Really!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.000
Great! Great!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.040
Thank you, thank you!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.000
You can't do such an easy task
even with your smart brain.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.370
Chen Bin!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:54.410
The data of the seventh victim
is missing in the case.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:55.410
Chen Bin,

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.450
Chen Bin!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.500
Brat, where did he go?

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.700
Hey, where are you?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.370
Why did you give it to me
without checking it carefully?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.370
One piece of information is missing.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.200
Bring it to me quickly!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.160
What?

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.450
Brother Liang came to you again?

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:11.830
Yes,

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.660
he insisted that he wanted
a video of the past

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.950
to look for clues to find Dou Dou.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.450
This is a case that
happened three years ago.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.290
I can't just copy the video
for you to take it away!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.410
I know, but isn't this
what you said, leader Xiao?

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.700
To try our best to help him,
no matter what?

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.830
All right, all right,
come back when you're done!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.580
I just accompanied him to clear
some fake rumours this morning,

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.580
and there is another new rumours
emerged from nowhere?

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:33.910
Master Wang,

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.000
please make it an exception,

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.120
just cut the surveillance video and
send it to me and your job is done!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.120
This is not possible!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.660
Rules are rules,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.830
and the video is so long.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.580
How do I know which part you want?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.410
No, no.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.000
Just send the 15 seconds
video to my phone,

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.700
deal or no deal!

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.160
The video of the past?

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:53.830
This is a confidential document.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.580
It is only for internal use.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.330
Do not forward.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.450
Thank you.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.410
Brother Liang, I've cut a section
of the surveillance video for you,

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.330
do you think it is okay?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:05.290
Ah, oh ya,
this is an internal document.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.500
Don't forward it to others.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.660
Miss Qiao,

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:11.910
this is the only video data
at the time of the incident.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:14.250
I hope it is possible to
find clues of Dou Dou from it.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.500
Thank you so much.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.450
I really appreciate it!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.660
Oh, and,

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.370
the video was taken with the help
of a friend from the police team.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.160
Please don't spread it out.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.450
This video is important.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.450
Don't send it to Cheng XiaoShi.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:28.870
What does Qiao Ling mean,

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.160
she does not trust me?

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.790
I'm such a tight-lipped person.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.870
Give it to me.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.250
The place Dou Dou was sitting

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.200
is a blind spot in the surveillance video.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.500
I can't see the situation well.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.950
Do you remember the approximate
time of the disappearance?

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:48.580
That afternoon,
the weather was very hot.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.580
Business in the store was very good.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.700
Dou Dou was clamouring
his mother to play with him.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.450
I gave him my phone,

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:57.330
then, I don't know how long it has been.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.830
I was so busy at that time,

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.120
but I caught a glimpse of the wall clock.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.700
It is about two o'clock,

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.950
around two-fifty in the afternoon.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.660
Not long after,

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.950
my wife found out that
Dou Dou was missing.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:16.950
By the way,

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.620
if you use your predictive ability to
see from the surveillance video,

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.200
how will it be like?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.410
Within 12 hours,

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:25.450
all surveillance images
within one kilometer,

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:27.040
I can have a panoramic view of them.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.910
But the blind spot of the video,

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:32.160
it will become my blind spot, too.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.750
Can you see Dou Dou?

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.120
Who took him away?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.580
The one who took Dou Dou away

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.870
must have surveyed this area long ago.

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:44.080
He used the surveillance camera
blind spots perfectly.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:46.790
There is no evidence
to investigate further.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.120
So,

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.750
I still need you to go in.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.450
When I entered the photo before this,

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.080
I will always be the one taking photos.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:57.500
Then this time, will I become...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.700
...a CCTV?

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:00.700
Stupid,

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.160
what are you thinking about?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.080
Just follow my instructions.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:20.290
A cup of milk foam black tea,
add ice, half sugar.

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.200
Take away? Wait a minute.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.700
How did I get into the photo by myself?

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.450
This place is three years ago?

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.950
You have only 12 hours
during this period.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.620
You must keep yourself low profile,

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.200
just like you have never shown up here.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.790
Don't change anything in the past.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.580
Don't attract anyone's attention.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:00.660
Since you knew it beforehand,

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.080
why can't you tell me in advance?

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.950
I am sorry, I thought your existence
won't attract attention.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.790
I haven't seen any suspicious
people around yet.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.790
Lu Guang, if...

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.540
Do you know why I agreed to
pass the words to the deceased?

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:24.910
Of course, I know

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:27.750
these words cannot
change their fate of death.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.250
But these words

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.790
can let the living ones

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.330
have no regrets.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.370
Ah!

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.410
He appeared!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:52.870
Where did they go?

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.250
The second alley on the right.

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:04.250
Wait! Don't go there!

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:08.410
Cheng XiaoShi?

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:17.330
You!

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.870
Why are you here?
